  [170/1150] "<think>\nAlright, so I need to figure out whether Christina should pass the message to Tiffany or Theodore to get to Emress the fastest. Let's break this down step by step.\n\nFirst, I'll map out the friendships to see the connections. \n\nChristina is friends with Tiffany and Theodore. So from her, she can go to Tiffany or Theodore.\n\nLooking at Tiffany's friends: She's connected to Kai, Faiga, and Katherine. From Tiffany, she can reach Faiga, who is friends with Nevaeh and Emress. So one path from Tiffany to Emress is Tiffany -> Faiga -> Nevaeh -> Emress. That's three steps.\n\nAlternatively, from Theodore, he's friends with Yitta and Colette. Yitta is friends with Emress and Colette. So another path is Theodore -> Yitta -> Emress. That's two steps.\n\nComparing both paths, the one through Theodore is shorter. So the shortest path is Theodore -> Yitta -> Emress. Therefore, Christina should pass the message to Theodore first.\n</think>\n\ntheodore->yitta->empress tuesday"  correct=theodore
