  [190/1150] "<think>\nAlright, so I need to figure out whether Tiffany should pass the message to Christina or Faiga to get to Colette the fastest. Let's break this down step by step.\n\nFirst, I'll map out the friendships to see the connections. Tiffany is friends with Kait, Faiga, and Katherine. Faiga is also friends with Nevaeh and Tanya. Kait is friends with Nevaeh and Toby. Toby is friends with Kait, Nevaeh, and Katherine. Katherine is friends with Toby and Tanya. Tanya is friends with Colette and Yitta. Colette is friends with Yitta, Tanya, and Emilia. Yitta is friends with Emilia and Colette. Emilia is friends with Yitta and Colette. Colette is also friends with Emilia and Yitta. \n\nWait, I think I might have mixed up some names. Let me correct that. Colette is friends with Yitta, Tanya, and Emilia. Yitta is friends with Emilia and Colette. Emilia is friends with Yitta and Coelia (but that's not in the list). So Emilia is only friends with Yitta. \n\nLooking at the connections from Tiffany, she can go to Kait, Faiga, or Katherine. Kait is connected to Nevaeh and Toby. Toby is connected to Kait, Nevaeh, and Katherine. Katherine is connected to Toby and Tanya. Tanya is connected to Colette and Yitta. Yitta is connected to Colette and Emilia. Emilia is only connected to Yitta. \n\nSo, if Tiffany goes to Kait, she can reach Nevaeh and Toby. Toby can then reach Katherine, who can reach Tanya, who can reach Colette. Alternatively, if Tiffany goes to Faiga, she can reach Nevaeh and Tanya. Tanya can then reach Colette. \n\nWait, but Colette is also connected to Yitta, who is connected to Emilia, but that's a longer path. So the shortest path from Tiffany to Colette would be through either Kait -> Toby -> Katherine -> Tanya -> Colette or through Faiga -> Tanya -> Colette. \n\nComparing the two paths: Kait -> Toby -> Katherine -> Tanya -> Colette is 4 steps, while Faiga -> Tanya -> Colette is 2 steps. So the shorter path is through Faiga. \n\nTherefore, Tiffany shoul