s: Theodore and Russell. From Theodore, friends are Yitta, Christina, and Colette. Yitta is friends with Emress and Colette. Emress is friends with Vanessa and Yitta. Vanessa is friends with Russell and Emress. So, Colette -> Theodore -> Yitta -> Emress -> Vanessa -> Russell. That's 5 steps.\n\nAlternatively, Colette -> Russell -> Vanessa -> Emress -> Yitta -> Theodorus -> Kaitlyn. That's 6 steps. So, the first path is shorter.\n\nWait, but maybe there's a shorter path through another route. Let me check if there's a connection I'm missing.\n\nLooking at the connections again, Colette is friends with Theodore and Russell. From Theodore, friends are Yitta, Christina, and Colette. Yitta is friends with Emress and Colette. Emress is friends with Vanessa and Yitta. Vanessa is friends with Russell and Emress. So, Colette -> Theodore -> Yitta -> Emress -> Vanessa -> Russell. That's 5 steps.\n\nAlternatively, Colette -> Russell -> Vanessa -> Emress -> Yitta -> Theodorus -> Kaitlyn. That's 6 steps. So, the first path is shorter.\n\nWait, but maybe there's a way through Kaitlyn. Let me see. Kaitlyn is friends with Toby and Faiga. To be honest, I'm getting a bit confused. Maybe I should draw this out.\n\nAlternatively, perhaps there's a shorter path through another route. Let me think again.\n\nColette is connected to Theodore and Russell. From Theodore, friends are Yitta, Christina, and Colette. Yitta is connected to Emress and Colette. Emress is connected to Vanessa and Yitta. Vanessa is connected to Russell and Emress. So, Colette -> Theodore -> Yitta -> Emress -> Vanessa -> Russell. That's 5 steps.\n\nAlternatively, Colette -> Russell -> Vanessa -> Emress -> Yitta -> Theodorus -> Kaitlyn. That's 6 steps. So, the first path is shorter.\n\nWait, but maybe there's a way through Kaitlyn. Kaitlyn is friends with Toby and Faiga. To be honest, I'm not sure if that's relevant here. Maybe I should focus on the direct connections.\n\nSo, the shortest path from Colette to Katherine 