.\n\nThe path through Eyad is three steps: Alessandra -> Eyad -> Egypt -> Bruchy.\n\nWait, no, because Egypt is friends with Bruchy, so it's two steps from Eyad to Bruchy. So the path through Eyad is three steps in total: Alessandra -> Eyad -> Egypt -> Bruchy.\n\nBut the path through Aissatou is two steps: Alessandra -> Aissatou -> Bruchy.\n\nSo the shortest path is through Aissatou, which is two steps. Therefore, Alessandra should pass the message to Aissatou first.\n</think>\n\naissatou aissatou"  correct=aissatou
