  [389/1150] "<think>\nAlright, let's tackle this problem step by step. Prince wants to pass a message to Connor as efficiently as possible. I need to figure out the shortest path he can take, either through Hafsa or Sulaiman. \n\nFirst, I'll map out the connections based on the given friendships. Let's see:\n\n- Prince is friends with Sulaiman.\n- Sulaiman is friends with Jonathan and Emery.\n- Jonathan is friends with Connor.\n- So, one path is Prince -> Sulaiman -> Jonathan -> Connor.\n\nNow, looking at the other option, Hafsa:\n- Prince is friends with Hafsa.\n- Hafsa is friends with Fanta and Eysa.\n- Fanta is friends with Jonathan.\n- Eysa is friends with Emery and Maimouna.\n- Emery is friends with Seth and Aimee.\n- Seth is friends with Maimouna and Eysa.\n- Maimouna is friends with Aimee and Pedro.\n- Aimee is friends with Abid and Emery.\n- Abid is friends with Pedro.\n- Pedro is friends with Maimouna.\n- Wait, but this seems a bit convoluted. Let me see if there's a shorter path.\n\nAlternatively, Hafsa is directly connected to Fanta, who is connected to Jonathan. So another path is Prince -> Hafsa -> Fanta -> Jonathan -> Connor.\n\nComparing both paths:\n1. Prince -> Sulaiman -> Jonathan -> Connor (3 steps)\n2. Prince -> Hafsa -> Fanta -> Jonathan -> Connor (4 steps)\n\nSo the first path is shorter. Therefore, Prince should start by passing the message to Sulaiman.\n</think>\n\nthe shortest path is prince -> sulaiman -> jonathan -> connor. prince should begin by passing the message to sulaiman.\n\nsulaiman"  correct=sulaiman
