 Eyad: Emery -> Eyad -> Hafsa -> Prince (3 steps)\n\nSo the path through Eyad is shorter. Therefore, Emery should pass the message to Eyad to reach Prince more efficiently.\n</think>\n\nthe shortest path is emery -> eyad -> hafsa -> prince. emery should begin by passing the message to eyad.\n\neyad"  correct=eyad
