hat's four steps.\n\nAlternatively, if Aimee goes to Maimouna, who is connected to Pedro, who is connected to Abdul, who is connected to Aimee. That's a loop. So no progress.\n\nWait, maybe through another route: Aimee -> Maimouna -> Pedro -> Abdul -> Aimee? No, that's not helpful. Alternatively, maybe Pedro is connected to someone else? Pedro is friends with Maimouna and Abdul. No, that's it.\n\nWait, maybe through another path: Aimee -> Emery -> Eysad -> Hafsa -> Fanta. That's four steps. Alternatively, if Aimee goes to Emery, who is connected to Eysad, who is connected to Hafsa, who is connected to Fanta. So that's four steps.\n\nAlternatively, if Aimee goes to Seth, who is connected to Maimouna, who is connected to Pedro, who is connected to Abdul, who is connected to Aimee. That's a loop. So no progress.\n\nWait, maybe through another route: Aimee -> Emery -> Eysad -> Hafsa -> Fanta. That's four steps. Alternatively, if Aimee goes to Emery, who is connected to Eysad, who is connected to Hafsa, who is connected to Fanta. So that's four steps.\n\nAlternatively, maybe through another path: Aimee -> Emery -> Eysad -> Hafsa -> Fanta. That's four steps.\n\nWait, but maybe there's a shorter path. Let me check again.\n\nAimee is connected to Emery and Maimouna.\n\nIf Aimee goes to Emery, Emery is connected to Eysad and Seth.\n\nIf she goes to Eysad, Eysad is connected to Hafsa.\n\nHafsa is connected to Fanta.\n\nSo the path is Aimee -> Emery -> Eysad -> Hafsa -> Fanta. That's four steps.\n\nAlternatively, if Aimee goes to Seth, Seth is connected to Maimouna.\n\nMaimouna is connected to Pedro and Abdul.\n\nPedro is connected to Maimouna and Abdul.\n\nAbdul is connected to Pedro and Aimee.\n\nSo from Seth to Maimouna, but that doesn't help.\n\nWait, maybe through another route: Aimee -> Emery -> Eysad -> Hafsa -> Fanta. That's four steps.\n\nAlternatively, if Aimee goes to Emery, who is connected to Eysad, who is connected to Hafsa, who is connected to Fanta. So that's f