ns are Hafsa or Jonathan. From Fanta, the direct friends are Prince and Hafsa. So the first step is either Prince or Hafsa. If he goes to Hafsa, then Hafsa is connected to Emery, who is connected to Seth. So the path is Fanta -> Hafsa -> Emery -> Seth. That's three steps.\n\nIf he goes to Prince, then Prince is connected to Hafsa, who is connected to Emery, who is connected to Seth. So that's Fanta -> Prince -> Hafsa -> Emery -> Seth. That's four steps. So the shortest path is through Hafsa, making the first step Hafsa.\n\nTherefore, Fanta should begin by passing the message to Hafsa.\n</think>\n\nhafsa -> emery -> seth\n\nhafsa"  correct=hafsa
