an and Aubyrey.\n- Terrell is friends with Yosef and Donovan.\n- Sadie is friends with Miah and Maxwell.\n- Stela is friends with Aubyrey and Yosef.\n- Max is friends with Sadie and Sadie? Wait, no, Maxwell is friends with Isiah and Sadie.\n\nWait, let me clarify each person's friends:\n\n1. Aubyrey: friends with Stela, Miah, Sadie, and Sanai.\n2. Terrell: friends with Sasha, Donovan, Yosef, and Esteban.\n3. Isiah: friends with Donovan, Maxwell, Ahnaf.\n4. Sadie: friends with Miah, Maxwell, and Aubyrey.\n5. Sasha: friends with Yosef, Terrell, Ahnaf.\n6. Yosef: friends with Sasha, Terrell, Stela.\n7. Miah: friends with Aubyrey, Sadie.\n8. Donovan: friends with Isiah, Terrell, Stela.\n9. Stela: friends with Aubyrey, Yosef, Sadie, Max.\n10. Maxwell: friends with Sadie, Isiah.\n\nWait, no, the initial list says:\n\naubrey is friends with stella. terrell is friends with sasha. donovan is friends with isiah. sadie is friends with maxwell. isiah is friends with donovan. sasha is friends with yosef. sasha is friends with terrell. ahnaf is friends with sasha. miah is friends with aubrey. yosef is friends with terrell. stella is friends with aubrey. maxwell is friends with sadie. donovan is friends with terrell. isiah is friends with maxwell. miah is friends with sadie. esteban is friends with stella. miah is friends with sadie. isiah is friends with ahnaf. aubrey is friends with miah. yosef is friends with sasha. aubrey is friends with sanai. sanai is friends with aubrey. terrell is friends with yosef. sadie is friends with miah. stella is friends with esteban. maxwell is friends with isiah. terrell is friends with donovan. stella is friends with sadie. sanai is friends with esteban. stella wants to pass a message most efficiently to maxwell, should stella begin by passing the message on to miah or sadie?\n\nWait, this is getting complicated. Let me try to build the graph step by step.\n\nFirst, let's list all the people and their friends:\n\n- Aubyrey: friends with Stela, Miah, Sadie, Sanai.\n- Terrell: friends with Sasha, Donovan, Yosef, Esteban.\n- Isiah: friends with Donovan, Maxwell, Ahnaf.\n- Sadie: friends with Miah, Maxwell, Aubyrey.\n- Sasha: friends with Yosef, Terrell, Ahnaf.\n- Yosef: friends with Sasha, Terrell, Stela.\n- Miah: friends with Aubyrey, Sadie.\n- Donovan: friends with Isiah, Terrell, Stela.\n- Stela: friends with Aubyrey, Yosef, Sadie, Maxwell.\n- Maxwell: friends with Sadie, Isiah.\n- Esteban: friends with Terrell, Sanai.\n- Sanai: friends with Aubyrey, Esteban.\n\nWait, that's the correct mapping. Now, the question is about the shortest path from Stela (Stella) to Maxwell.\n\nSo, starting from Stela, who is connected to Aubyrey, Yosef, Sadie, and Maxwell.\n\nBut the question is whether she should pass to Miah or Sadie first.\n\nSo, let's see:\n\nOption 1: Stela -> Sadie -> Maxwell.\n\nOption 2: Stela -> Miah -> ... but Miah is only connected to Aubyrey and Sadie. So from Miah, you can go to Sadie, but that's back to where you came from. So the path would be Stela -> Miah -> Sadie -> Maxwell. That's three steps.\n\nOption 1: Stela -> Sadie -> Maxwell. That's two steps.\n\nSo the shortest path is through Sadie.\n\nTherefore, the answer is Sadie.\n</think>\n\nstella -> sadie -> maxwell\n\nsadie"  correct=sadie
