he data, Miah is friends with Sadie and AHB (Aubrey). Sadie is friends with Maxwell. So, no direct connection from Miah to Maxwell. Therefore, the shortest path is through Sadie.\n\nSo, the answer should be that Stella should pass the message to Sadie first, making the path Stella -> Sadie -> Maxwell.\n</think>\n\nThe shortest path is "stella -> sadie -> maxwell". The correct option is sadie.'  correct=sadie
