n Miah can pass to AUBrey, who can pass to Sanai. So that\'s three steps: Stella -> Miah -> AUBrey -> Sanai. That\'s three steps, which is longer than the two-step path through Aubrey.\n\nSo the shortest path is through Aubrey, making the answer "aubrey".\n</think>\n\nThe shortest path from Stella to Sanai is through Aubrey, as it requires only two steps: Stella -> Aubrey -> Sanai. Therefore, the correct option is "aubrey".\n\naubrey sanai'  correct=aubrey
