to Donovan, then to Isiah, then to Ahnaf. That's 8 steps.\n\nAlternatively, from Miah, go to Auby, then to Miah's other friend, which is Sadie. Wait, no, Miah is friends with Auby, Sadie, and Stella. So, from Miah, she can go to Sadie directly. From Sadie, she can go to Maxwell or Miah. But that doesn't help. So, maybe from Sadie, she can go to Isiah? Wait, no, Isiah is connected to Donovan, not Sadie. So, that's not possible.\n\nWait, maybe from Sadie, she can go to Isiah through someone else. Let me check. Isiah is friends with Donovan and Ahnaf. Donovan is friends with Isiah and Terrell. Terrell is friends with Donovan and Sasha. Sasha is friends with Terrell and Yosef. Yosef is friends with Sasha and Terrell. Yosef is also friends with Esteban. Esteban is friends with Yosef and Sanai. Sanai is friends with Esteban and Auby. Auby is friends with Miah and Sanai. So, from Sadie, we can't reach Isiah directly. So, the only way is through the longer path.\n\nWait, maybe from Miah, go to Auby, then to Sanai, then to Esteban, then to Yosef, then to Sasha, then to Terrell, then to Donovan, then to Isiah, then to Ahnaf. That's 8 steps.\n\nAlternatively, from Miah, go to Stella. Stella is friends with Miah, Yosef, and Terrell. From Stella, she can go to Yosef or Terrell. Yosef is friends with Sasha and Esteban. Sasha is friends with Yosef and Terrell. Terrell is friends with Sasha and Donovan. Donovan is friends with Isiah and Terrell. Isiah is friends with Donovan and Ahnaf. So, from Miah to Stella to Terrell to Donovan to Isiah to Ahnaf. That's 5 steps.\n\nWait, that's shorter. So, the path would be Miah -> Stella -> Terrell -> Donovan -> Isiah -> Ahnaf. That's 5 steps.\n\nAlternatively, from Miah to Sadie, then Sadie can't reach Ahnaf directly, so we have to go through the longer path. So, the shortest path is through Stella.\n\nWait, but let me check again. From Miah to Stella, then to Terrell, then to Donovan, then to Isiah, then to Ahnaf. That's 5 steps. Alternative