h of these leads.\n\nIf aubrey goes to stella, stella is connected to donovan, terrell, sadie, miah, and esteban. From stella, can we reach isiah? Let\'s see: stella is connected to donovan, who is connected to isiah. So the path would be aubrey -> stella -> donovan -> isiah. That\'s three steps.\n\nIf aubrey goes to miah, miah is connected to sadie, donovan, esteban, stella, and sadie. From miah, can we reach isiah? Let\'s see: miah is connected to sadie, who is connected to maxwell, who is connected to isiah. So the path would be aubrey -> miah -> sadie -> maxwell -> isiah. That\'s four steps.\n\nIf aubrey goes to sanai, sanai is connected to esteban and aubrey. From sanai, can we reach isiah? Sanai is connected to esteban, who is connected to terrell, who is connected to donovan, who is connected to isiah. So the path would be aubrey -> sanai -> esteban -> terrell -> donovan -> isiah. That\'s five steps.\n\nComparing the three options, the shortest path is through stella, which takes three steps. So aubrey should pass the message to stella first.\n</think>\n\naubrey -> stella -> donovan -> isiah\n\nstella'  correct=stella
