mparing both options, the direct path through Yosef is shorter. So, the shortest path is Terrell -> Yosef -> Sadie.\n\nTherefore, Terrell should pass the message to Yosef first.\n</think>\n\nterrell -> yosef -> sadie donovan\n\nyosef"  correct=donovan
