er I thought that passing to Ahnaf would require three steps, while passing to Terrell would require two steps. So the shortest path is through Terrell.\n\nWait, but let me double-check. From E (Sasha) to D (Sadie):\n\n- E -> G (Yosef) -> K (Sadie): two steps.\n- E -> I (Ahnaf) -> F (Isiah) -> D (Sadie): three steps.\n\nSo the shortest path is two steps via Terrell.\n\nTherefore, Sasha should pass the message to Terrell first.\n</think>\n\nThe shortest path from Sasha to Sadie is through Terrell, making the path E -> G -> K. \n\nterrell"  correct=ahnaf
