 a direct connection. So the path would be Noor -> Faiga -> Yaakov. That's two steps.\n\nSecond path: Noor -> Caitlin. Caitlin is friends with Santiago, Yanki, and Xinx. Wait, Caitlin isn't directly connected to Yaakov. So from Caitlin, we need to go further. Caitlin is friends with Xinx, who is friends with Nusrat, who is friends with Yaakov. So that would be Noor -> Caitlin -> Xinx -> Nusrat -> Yaakov. That's four steps.\n\nComparing both paths, the first one is shorter. So Noor should pass the message to Faiga first.\n\nWait, but let me double-check. Is there any other connection from Caitlin to Yaakov? Caitlin is friends with Xinx, who is friends with Nusrat, who is friends with Yaakov. So yes, that's four steps. No direct connection from Caitlin to Yaakov.\n\nTherefore, the shortest path is Noor -> Faiga -> Yaakov.\n</think>\n\nnoor -> faiga -> yaakov faiga"  correct=faiga
