rough Mackenzie, so Jaliyah should pass to Mackenzie.\n\nWait, but let me double-check. From Jaliyah to Mackenzie is one step, then Mackenzie to Jorge is two, then Jorge to Lucy is three. So the path is three steps.\n\nAlternatively, if Jaliyah goes to Bruno, then Bruno to Lucie, then Lucie to Mackenzie, then Mackenzie to Jorge, then Jorge to Lucy. That's five steps.\n\nSo the shortest path is through Mackenzie, which is three steps. Therefore, Jaliyah should pass to Mackenzie first.\n</think>\n\nmackenzie jorge lucy\n\nmackenzie"  correct=bruno
