ection.\n\nTherefore, the shortest path is Lucy -> Bruno -> Jaliyah.\n\nSo, the answer is that Lucy should pass the message to Bruno first.\n</think>\n\nabdul -> jorge -> jonathan -> preston -> lucy -> ... (This path loops back to Lucy, which isn\'t helpful.)\n\nbruno -> jaliyah (This is a direct connection.)\n\nabdul\n\nbruno'  correct=bruno
