ice. Eunice is friends with Alyssa. So that's Mackenzie -> Derek -> Abdul -> Jorge -> Lucy -> Eunice -> Alyssa. That's 6 steps.\n\nAlternatively, is there a shorter path? Let's see if Mackenzie can reach Alyssa through another route. Mackenzie is friends with Jaliyah, who is friends with Bruno. Bruno is friends with Lucie. Lucie is friends with Preston. Preston is friends with Jonathon. Jonathon is friends with Jonathan. Jonathan is friends with Jaliyah. That's a loop, so not helpful.\n\nWait, another path: Mackenzie -> Jaliyah -> Bruno -> Lucie -> Lucy. Lucy is friends with Jorge, who is friends with Abdi, who is friends with Abdul, who is friends with Mackenzie. That's a loop again.\n\nAlternatively, from Lucy, she's friends with Jorge, who is friends with Abdi, who is friends with Abdul, who is friends with Mackenzie. So that's a cycle.\n\nWait, maybe another approach: Mackenzie -> Derek -> Abdul -> Jorge -> Lucy -> Eunice -> Alyssa. That's 6 steps.\n\nAlternatively, is there a way through Jaliyah? Mackenzie -> Jaliyah -> Bruno -> Lucie -> Lucy -> Eunice -> Alyssa. That's 6 steps as well.\n\nWait, perhaps a shorter path exists. Let me check the connections again.\n\nLooking at the connections, I see that Eunice is friends with both Aces and Cesar. Cesar is friends with Legend and Eunice. Legend is friends with Mackenzie and Cesar. So, from Eunice, you can go to Cesar, then to Legend, then to Mackenzie. But that's going back.\n\nAlternatively, from Eunice, you can go to Cesar, then to Legend, then to Mackenzie, but that's not helpful for reaching Alyssa.\n\nWait, Alyssa is friends with Eunice and Derek. So, if Mackenzie can reach Alyssa directly through Derek, that's the shortest path. So, Mackenzie -> Derek -> Alyssa. That's two steps.\n\nWait, but in the initial connections, Derek is friends with M and A. A is Alyssa. So yes, that's a direct connection. So the path is Mackenzie -> Derek -> Alyssa.\n\nBut earlier, I thought of a longer path through Derek -> Abdul