  [750/1150] '<think>\nAlright, so I need to figure out the shortest path for Bruno to pass a message to Jonathan. Let\'s break this down step by step.\n\nFirst, I\'ll list out all the friends each person has based on the given information. This will help me visualize the connections.\n\nStarting with Bruno:\n- Bruno is friends with Jaliyah, Lucy, and Abdul. (From the data: Bruno is friends with Jaliyah, Abdul, and Lucy.)\n\nNext, I\'ll look at who Jaliyah is connected to:\n- Jaliyah is friends with Bruno, Mackenzie, and Abdul. (From the data: Jaliyah is friends with Mackenzie and Abdul besides Bruno.)\n\nNow, looking at Lucy:\n- Lucy is friends with Bruno, Abdul, and Jorge. (From the data: Lucy is friends with Bruno, Abdul, and Jorge.)\n\nOur goal is to find the shortest path from Bruno to Jonathan. Let\'s see how they\'re connected.\n\nStarting from Bruno, he can go to Jaliyah, Abdul, or Lucy. Let\'s explore each option.\n\nOption 1: Bruno -> Jaliyah\nFrom Jaliyah, he can go to Mackenzie or Abdul. Let\'s see where that leads.\n\nIf Bruno -> Jaliyah -> Abdul, then Abdul is connected to Jaliyah, Bruno, Lucy, and Jorge. From Abdul, he can go to Lucy or Jorge. Lucy is connected to Bruno, Abdul, and Jorge. From Lucy, she\'s connected to Jorge. Jorge is connected to Lucy, Bruno, and Jonathan. So, from Jorge, he can go to Jonathan. So the path would be Bruno -> Jaliyah -> Abdul -> Lucy -> Jorge -> Jonathan. That\'s 5 steps.\n\nOption 2: Bruno -> Lucy\nFrom Lucy, she can go to Bruno, Abdul, or Jorge. Let\'s see.\n\nIf Bruno -> Lucy -> Abdul, then from Abdul, same as before, to Jorge, then to Jonathan. That\'s also 5 steps.\n\nAlternatively, Bruno -> Lucy -> Jorge. From Jorge, he can go directly to Jonathan. So the path would be Bruno -> Lucy -> J Jorge -> Jonathan. That\'s 3 steps.\n\nWait, that\'s shorter. So Bruno can go to Lucy, then to Jorge, then to Jonathan. That\'s only 3 steps.\n\nBut wait, is Jorge directly connected to Jonathan? Let me check the data.\n\nLooking