's see. Miah is friends with Trinity, who is friends with Binyomin, who is friends with Red, who is friends with Yaakov. So, that's four steps, but the path is Miah -> Trinity -> Binyomin -> Red.\n\nWait, no, the path is Miah to Trinity (1), Trinity to Binyomin (2), Binyomin to Red (3), Red to Yaakov (4). So, the path is four steps, but the question is about the shortest path. Is there a shorter path?\n\nAlternatively, Miah could go to Dallas, but from Dallas, as we saw, it's not possible to reach Yaakov without looping back. So, the only way is through Trinity.\n\nTherefore, the shortest path is Miah -> Trinity -> Binyomin -> Red. So, Miah should pass the message to Trinity first.\n</think>\n\ndallas trinity"  correct=trinity
