plicating. Let me list the paths again.\n\nPath 1: Quin -> Esmeralda -> Magaly -> Kendra. That's three steps.\n\nPath 2: Quin -> Malak -> Sima -> Esteban -> Kendra. That's four steps.\n\nWait, but maybe there's a shorter path through another route. Let me check if Malak is connected to anyone else who can get to Kendra faster.\n\nWait, Malak is friends with Quin, Sima, and Isiah. Isiah is friends with Ayden, who is friends with Quin and Esmeralda. So from Malak to Isiah to Ayden to Quin to Esmeralda. That's four steps.\n\nAlternatively, from Malak to Sima to Esteban to Kendra. That's three steps: Quin -> Malak -> Sima -> Esteban -> Kendra. Wait, that's four steps as well.\n\nWait, but maybe from Malak, you can go to Isiah, then to Cam, then to Ayden, then to Quin, then to Esmeralda. That's five steps.\n\nHmm, so the shortest path from Quin to Kendra is through Esmeralda: Quin -> Esmeralda -> Magaly -> Kendra. That's three steps.\n\nAlternatively, through Malak: Quin -> Malak -> Sima -> Esteban -> Kendra. That's four steps.\n\nWait, but maybe there's a shorter path through another route. Let me check again.\n\nWait, maybe from Malak, you can go to Isiah, then to Ayden, then to Quin, then to Esmeralda. That's four steps.\n\nAlternatively, from Malak to Sima to Esteban to Kendra. That's four steps.\n\nWait, but maybe from Malak, you can go to Isiah, then to Cam, then to Ayden, then to Quin, then to Esmeralda. That's five steps.\n\nWait, I'm getting confused. Let me try to map it out properly.\n\nQuin is connected to Esmeralda and Malak.\n\nFrom Esmeralda, connected to Quin, Magaly, and Ayden.\n\nFrom Magaly, connected to Kendra.\n\nSo Quin -> Esmeralda -> Magaly -> Kendra: 3 steps.\n\nFrom Malak, connected to Quin, Sima, and Isiah.\n\nFrom Sima, connected to Quin, Esteban, and Franscua.\n\nFrom Esteban, connected to Kendra.\n\nSo Quin -> Malak -> Sima -> Esteban -> Kendra: 4 steps.\n\nAlternatively, from Malak to Isiah, who is connected to Ayden, who is connected to Quin and Esmeralda.\n\nSo Quin -> Malak -> Isiah -> Ayden -> Quin -> Esmeralda: 5 steps.\n\nWait, but that's looping back to Quin, which isn't helpful.\n\nAlternatively, from Isiah to Cam, who is connected to Malak, but that's a loop.\n\nWait, maybe from Isiah to Ayden, then to Esmeralda. So Quin -> Malak -> Isiah -> Ayden -> Esmeralda: 4 steps.\n\nSo the shortest path is through Esmeralda, taking 3 steps.\n\nTherefore, Quin should pass to Esmeralda first.\n</think>\n\nquinn -> esmeralda -> magaly -> kendra\n\nesmeralda"  correct=esmeralda
