e steps. So from Isiah to Ayden to Quinna to Magaly. That\'s three steps.\n\nSimilarly, from Isiah to Cameron to Malak to Quinna to Magaly. That\'s four steps. So the shorter path is through Ayden.\n\nWait, but earlier I thought both were four steps, but now I see that through Ayden, it\'s three steps. So the shortest path is through Ayden.\n\nSo, the answer should be that Isiah should pass the message to Ayden, as the shortest path is Isiah -> Ayden -> Quinna -> Magaly, which is three steps.\n</think>\n\nThe shortest path from Isiah to Magaly is through Ayden. \n\nayden'  correct=ayden
