alda, then Esmeralda to Quin, then Quin to Malk, then Malk to Sima, then Sima to Esteban. That\'s five steps.\n\nSo the shortest path is through Quin, taking four steps.\n\nWait, but maybe there\'s a shorter path. Let me check if there\'s a connection from Quin to Esteban through another route.\n\nQuin is friends with Malk and Esmeralda. Malk is friends with Sima and Joziah. Joziah is friends with Malc and Kendra. Kendra is friends with Magaly. Magaly is friends with Quin and Kendra. So from Quin to Malk to Sima to Esteban is three steps.\n\nSo the path would be Ayden -> Quin -> Malk -> Sima -> Esteban. That\'s four steps.\n\nAlternatively, Ayden -> Quin -> Esmeralda -> Magaly -> Kendra -> Joziah -> Malc -> Sima -> Esteban. That\'s eight steps, which is longer.\n\nSo the shortest path is four steps, starting with Quin.\n\nWait, but the question is whether Ayden should pass the message to Quin or Esmeralda first. So the first step is either Quin or Esmeralda.\n\nFrom the analysis, the shortest path is through Quin, so Ayden should pass to Quin first.\n\nSo the answer is "quinn" as the first step, and the shortest path is Ayden -> Quin -> Malk -> Sima -> Esteban.\n</think>\n\nquinn'  correct=esmeralda
