rom the list, I don\'t see Joziah directly connected to Ayden. So the shortest path must go through friends.\n\nAlternatively, Joziah -> Kendra. Kendra is friends with Esteban and Magaly. Esteban is friends with Sima. Sima is friends with Malcom and Esteban. Sima is friends with Esmeralda. Esmeralda is friends with Quin. Quin is friends with Malak. Malak is friends with Ayden. So the path would be Joziah -> Kendra -> Esteban -> Sima -> Esmeralda -> Quin -> Malak -> Ayden. That\'s 7 steps as well.\n\nWait, but maybe there\'s a shorter path. Let me see if there\'s a connection from Kendra to Ayden. Kendra is friends with Magaly, who is friends with Malcom. Malcom is friends with Francesca, who is friends with Sima, who is friends with Esmeralda, who is friends with Quin, who is friends with Malak, who is friends with Ayden. So that\'s 7 steps as well.\n\nWait, maybe I\'m missing a connection. Let me check if there\'s a direct connection from Malcom to Ayden. From the list, Malcom is friends with Joziah, Francesca, and Malcolm. No direct connection to Ayden. So the path must go through friends.\n\nWait, maybe through Isiah. Ayden is friends with Isiah, who is friends with Camero, who is friends with Malak, who is friends with Ayden. So that\'s a loop. Not helpful.\n\nWait, maybe through Quin. Ayden is friends with Esmeralda, who is friends with Quin, who is friends with Malak, who is friends with Ayden. So that\'s a loop.\n\nWait, maybe the shortest path is through Sima. Ayden is friends with Esmeralda, who is friends with Sima, who is friends with Malcom, who is friends with Joziah. Wait, that\'s Joziah -> Malcom -> Sima -> Esmeralda -> Ayden. That\'s 4 steps.\n\nWait, but is Sima friends with Esmeralda? Yes, from the list: esmeralda is friends with magaly, quin, and sima. So yes, Sima is friends with Esmeralda. So the path would be Joziah -> Malcom -> Sima -> Esmeralda -> Ayden. That\'s 4 steps.\n\nAlternatively, Joziah -> Malcom -> Francesca -> Sima -> Esmeralda -> 