  [1037/1150] '<think>\nAlright, let\'s tackle this problem step by step. So, we have a bunch of people connected through friendships, and we need to figure out the shortest path for Yechezkel to pass a message to Vihaan. The question is whether she should send it to Journey or Jayceon first.\n\nFirst, I\'ll try to map out the connections. Let\'s see, Yechezkel is friends with Journey and Jayceon. So, from Yechezkel, the immediate friends are Journey and Jayceon. That\'s the first step.\n\nNow, we need to see which of these two can reach Vihaan faster. Let\'s explore both paths.\n\nStarting with Journey: Journey is friends with Ruth, Vihaan, and Yechezkel. Wait, but we\'re going from Journey to Vihaan. So, Journey is directly connected to Vihaan. That would be a one-step path: Yechezkel -> Journey -> Vihaan.\n\nNow, looking at Jayceon: Jayceon is friends with Tessa, Yechezkel, and Harlow. Tessa is friends with Freddy and Journey. Freddy is friends with Raymond and Claudia. Raymond is friends with Claudia and Harlow. Wait, so from Jayceon, we go to Tessa, then Tessa to Freddy, Freddy to Raymond, Raymond to Claudia, Claudia to Harlow, and Harlow to Jayceon. That seems like a longer path, but let\'s see if there\'s a shorter way.\n\nAlternatively, from Jayceon, we can go to Tessa, then Tessa to Freddy, Freddy to Claudia, Claudia to Harlow, and Harlow to Jayceon. But that\'s a cycle, so it doesn\'t help. Alternatively, from Jayceon to Tessa, Tessa to Freddy, Freddy to Raymond, Raymond to Claudia, Claudia to Harlow, Harlow to Jayceon. Still, that\'s a loop. So, maybe there\'s a shorter path through another route.\n\nWait, perhaps from Jayceon, we can go to Tessa, then Tessa to Freddy, Freddy to Claudia, Claudia to Harlow, Harlow to Jayceon. But that\'s a cycle again. Alternatively, from Jayceon to Tessa, Tessa to Freddy, Freddy to Raymond, Raymond to Claudia, Claudia to Harlow, Harlow to Jayceon. Still, it\'s a loop. Hmm, maybe there\'s another way.\n\nWait, perhaps from