audia, Claudia to Harlow, Harlow to Jayceon. But that\'s a cycle. Alternatively, from Jayceon to Tessa, Tessa to Freddy, Freddy to Raymond, Raymond to Claudia, Claudia to Harlow, Harlow to Jayceon. Still, no direct path to Vihaan.\n\nWait, perhaps from Jayceon, we can go to Tessa, then Tessa to Freddy, Freddy to Claudia, Claudia to Harlow, Harlow to Jayceon. But that\'s a cycle. Alternatively, from Jayceon to Tessa, Tessa to Freddy, Freddy to Raymond, Raymond to Claudia, Claudia to Harlow, Harlow to Jayceon. Still, no direct path to Vihaan.\n\nWait, maybe I\'m overcomplicating this. The direct path from Journey to Vihaan is one step. So, the path through Journey is Yechezkel -> Journey -> Vihaan, which is two steps. The path through Jayceon would require going through multiple people, which is longer. So, the shortest path is through Journey.\n\nWait, but let me double-check. From Jayceon, can we reach Vihaan in fewer steps? Let\'s see: Jayceon is friends with Tessa, who is friends with Freddy, who is friends with Claudia, who is friends with Harlow, who is friends with Jayceon. So, that\'s a cycle. Alternatively, from Jayceon to Tessa, Tessa to Freddy, Freddy to Raymond, Raymond to Claudia, Claudia to Harlow, Harlow to Jayceon. Still, no direct path to Vihaan.\n\nWait, but Vihaan is friends with Ruth, who is friends with Yechezkel. So, perhaps from Jayceon, we can go to Tessa, then Tessa to Freddy, Freddy to Claudia, Claudia to Harlow, Harlow to Jayceon. But that\'s a cycle. Alternatively, from Jayceon to Tessa, Tessa to Freddy, Freddy to Raymond, Raymond to Claudia, Claudia to Harlow, Harlow to Jayceon. Still, no direct path to Vihaan.\n\nWait, maybe from Jayceon, we can go to Tessa, then Tessa to Freddy, Freddy to Claudia, Claudia to Harlow, Harlow to Jayceon. But that\'s a cycle. Alternatively, from Jayceon to Tessa, Tessa to Freddy, Freddy to Raymond, Raymond to Claudia, Claudia to Harlow, Harlow to Jayceon. Still, no direct path to Vihaan.\n\nWait, perhaps I\'