s shorter.\n\nWait, but earlier I thought the path through vihaan and ruth was shorter, but now considering yechezkel, it's even shorter. So, the shortest path is journey -> yechezkel -> jayceon -> tessa, which is three steps. The other path is four steps. Therefore, journey should pass to yechezkel first.\n</think>\n\nyechezkel -> jayceon -> tessa yechezkel"  correct=yechezkel
