  [1118/1150] "<think>\nAlright, so I need to figure out whether Freddy should pass the message to Claire or Tessa. Let's break this down step by step.\n\nFirst, I know Freddy is friends with Raymond and also with Tessa. So, from Freddy, the immediate friends are Raymond and Tessa. So, the first step is either Raymond or Tessa.\n\nLooking at the connections, Raymond is friends with Claudio. So if Freddy passes to Raymond, then Raymond can pass to Claudio. Claudio is also friends with Harlow, and Harlow is friends with Jaceon, and Jaceon is friends with Yechezkel. That's a path: Freddy -> Raymond -> Claudio -> Harlow -> Jaceon -> Yechezkel.\n\nAlternatively, if Freddy passes to Tessa, Tessa is friends with Freddy, Jaceon, and also with Yechezkel. So, Freddy -> Tessa -> Yechezkel. That's a direct two-step connection.\n\nComparing the two paths, the direct path through Tessa is shorter. So, Freddy should pass the message to Tessa first.\n</think>\n\nThe shortest path is freddy -> tessa. tessa."  correct=tessa
