ceon, so maybe through Journey to Yechezkel, but I don't see a direct connection from Yechezkel to Jayceon. Alternatively, from Journey, go back to Ruth, then to Vihaan, then to Journey again, which doesn't help. Hmm, maybe this path isn't leading directly to Jayceon.\n\nAlternatively, from Ruth, go to Journey. Journey is friends with Vihaan and Yechezkel. From Journey to Vihaan, but Vihaan doesn't connect to Jayceon directly. From Journey to Yechezkel, but I don't see a connection from Yechezkel to Jayceon. Alternatively, from Journey, go to Yechezkel, but that's a dead end. So maybe this path isn't working.\n\nWait, perhaps I'm missing something. Let's see: Mya -> Ruth -> Journey -> Yechezkel. But does Yechezkel connect to Jayceon? Yes, because Yechezkel is friends with Journey, but that's already been used. Wait, no, the data says Yechezkel is friends with Journey, but does Yechezkel connect to anyone else? The data doesn't mention anyone else beyond Journey. So maybe this path isn't working.\n\nAlternatively, from Mya -> Ruth -> Vihaan -> Litzy -> Aidan -> Mya? That's a loop, not helpful.\n\nWait, perhaps I'm overcomplicating. Let's try the other path: Mya -> Aidan.\n\n1. Mya -> Aidan\n2. Aidan is friends with Mya and Litzy. So from Aidan, go to Litzy.\n3. Litzy is friends with Aidan and Vihaan. From Litzy, go to Vihaan.\n4. Vihaan is friends with Mya, Ruth, Litzy. From Vihaan, go to Ruth.\n5. Ruth is friends with Mya, Journey, Vihaan. From Ruth, go to Journey.\n6. Journey is friends with Vihaan, Ruth, Yechezkel. From Journey, go to Yechezkel.\n7. Yechezkel is friends with Journey, but that's already been used. Wait, does Yechezkel connect to anyone else? The data says Yechezkel is friends with Journey, but that's it. So maybe this path isn't working.\n\nWait, perhaps I'm missing a connection. Let me check again. Mya is connected to Aidan and Ruth. Aidan is connected to Litzy. Litzy is connected to Vihaan. Vihaan is connected to Mya, Ruth, and Litzy. Ruth is con