Jayceon, which is 4 steps.\n\nAlternatively, Mya -> Aidan -> ... but Aidan doesn\'t connect to anyone who can reach Jayceon directly. So the shortest path is through Mya -> Journey -> Yechezkel -> Jayceon, which is 3 steps.\n\nWait, but Mya can also go through Vihaan to Journey, which is 3 steps as well. So both Mya -> Vihaan -> Journey -> Yechezkel -> Jayceon (4 steps) and Mya -> Journey -> Yechezkel -> Jayceon (3 steps). So the shorter path is 3 steps via Mya -> Journey -> Yechezkel -> Jayceon.\n\nWait, but Mya can go directly to Journey? Wait, no, Mya is friends with Ruth, Vihaan, and Aidan. Journey is friends with Ruth, Mya, Yechezkel, and Vihaan. So Mya is not directly connected to Journey. So Mya can\'t go directly to Journey. So the path must go through someone who is connected to both Mya and Journey.\n\nSo Mya is friends with Vihaan, who is friends with Journey. So Mya -> Vihaan -> Journey -> Yechezkel -> Jayceon. That\'s 4 steps.\n\nAlternatively, Mya -> Aidan -> ... but Aidan doesn\'t connect to anyone who can reach Jayceon. So the only way is through Mya -> Vihaan -> Journey -> Yechezkel -> Jayceon.\n\nWait, but is there a shorter path? Let me check again.\n\nWait, Mya is friends with Vihaan, who is friends with Journey. Journey is friends with Yechezkel, who is friends with Jayceon. So that\'s Mya -> Vihaan -> Journey -> Yechezkel -> Jayceon, which is 4 steps.\n\nAlternatively, Mya -> Ruth -> Journey -> Yechezkel -> Jayceon. That\'s also 4 steps.\n\nSo the shortest path is 4 steps, but the question is whether Mya should send to Aidan or Vihaan first. Since Aidan doesn\'t lead to Jayceon, the only option is to send to Vihaan.\n\nWait, but the question is whether Mya should pass to Aidan or Vihaan. Since Aidan doesn\'t connect to Jayceon, the correct option is to send to Vihaan.\n\nWait, but the question is about the first step. Mya has two options: send to Aidan or Vihaan. Since Vihaan is directly connected to Mya and can reach Jayceon, while Aidan canno