y, who is friends with vihaan, who is friends with ruth. So that's four steps from jayceon to ruth. So the path via jayceon is harlow (1) -> jayceon (2) -> yechezkel (3) -> journey (4) -> vihaan (5) -> ruth (6). So 5 steps in total.\n\nAlternatively, via claudia, it's harlow (1) -> claudia (2) -> raymond (3) -> freddy (4) -> tessa (5) -> jayceon (6) -> yechezkel (7) -> journey (8) -> vihaan (9) -> ruth (10). That's 10 steps, which is way longer.\n\nSo the shortest path is via jayceon, which is harlow -> jayceon -> yechezkel -> journey -> vihaan -> ruth. So harlow should pass the message to jayceon first.\n</think>\n\nharlow -> jayceon -> yechezkel -> journey -> vihaan -> ruth jayceon"  correct=jayceon
